# L §8.4, L §5.14 Keys, E §4.1 step 2, E §4.2 Holes and refusals in the walk (tally 2.1.6, issue #51, the
# coordinator's pick P2): a move bound over a kind whose key's `where` is refused for one member (bob: 1 / 0) makes a
# refused instance, which reaches as a hole movement does: the places its legs give (konto, world) from its day
# (2026-02-10), and `flows` of the move over a span that holds it. konto before its day (2026-01-15), the place
# `other` that dues never touches, gift's `flows` and a count over the kind stand. refcore 2.1.5 let the `where`'s
# refusal leave the plan pass, so every balance was refused from the run's start, `other` included.
=== m.tally
model p51
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-15
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-03-31

source fixture "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

kind member

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..

place other: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..

place world: outside lives 2025-01-01..

input cnt[p in member]: int

input pay_day: date

input fee: money PLN

move dues[p in member on pay_day where 1 / cnt[p] > 0]: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from konto to world amount fee

move gift: transfers
  on pay_day
  leg cash from world to other amount fee

ask q_bal: bal(konto, 2026-01-15), bal(konto, 2026-02-28) law cut

ask q_other: bal(other, 2026-01-15), bal(other, 2026-02-28) law cut

ask q_flows: flows(dues, 2026-02-01 .. 2026-02-28), flows(gift, 2026-02-01 .. 2026-02-28) law cut

ask q_n: count(p in member on pay_day) law cut

version facts
  cite fixture
  governs always
  known 2025-12-01
  member + [ana, bob, cid] lives 2025-01-01..
  cnt[ana] = 1
  cnt[bob] = 0
  cnt[cid] = -1
  pay_day = 2026-02-10
  fee = 10.00
  opening[konto] = 100 at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[other] = 100 at 2026-01-01 start
=== expect
q_bal: (100.00 PLN, refused: RUN-DIV division by zero)
  unfulfilled: dues[ana]
  law date 2026-03-15, cut 2026-03-15
q_flows: (refused: RUN-DIV division by zero, 10.00 PLN)
  unfulfilled: dues[ana]
  unfulfilled: gift
  law date 2026-03-15, cut 2026-03-15
q_n: 3
  law date 2026-03-15, cut 2026-03-15
q_other: (100.00 PLN, 110.00 PLN)
  unfulfilled: gift
  law date 2026-03-15, cut 2026-03-15
